"""
generate_factsheets.py
======================
Reads the fund data workbook (one sheet per fund) plus riskometer / QR / logo
images and writes ONE combined, vector-quality A4 PDF: three pages per fund,
funds in workbook tab order.

    pip install reportlab openpyxl pillow
    python3 generate_factsheets.py                       # uses the paths in CONFIG
    python3 generate_factsheets.py --check               # validate only, no PDF
    python3 generate_factsheets.py --excel data.xlsx --out Sep2026.pdf --start-page 22

Design rules (as briefed)
-------------------------
  * ALL text is pure black (#000000).
  * Page background is cream  #FBF0E8  (251,240,232).
  * Charts / header bars / buttons use gold  #BE9036  (190,144,54).
  * Rules, borders, the 2nd chart series use navy  #08132D  (8,19,45).
  * No other colour is ever painted by this script (images keep their own colours).

Image naming (case-insensitive; .png / .jpg / .jpeg; spaces/underscores are interchangeable)
  Riskometer folder :  <Sheet>_scheme_riskometer   (or just <Sheet>)
                       <Sheet>_benchmark_riskometer
  QR Code folder    :  <Sheet>_qr   (or just <Sheet>)
  Logo              :  logo.png/jpg in the Factsheet folder (or Logo/ subfolder, or --logo)
  <Sheet> is the workbook tab name; the fund's printed name is also tried.
"""
